  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Artist's book included in issue no. 42 (Fall 2017) of the Journal of Artists' Books.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Paper Architecture is an artist's book inserted into JAB 42. Photography and design by Karen Wirth, offset printed by Brad Freeman at the Center for Book, Paper &amp; Print, Columbia College Chicago on the Heidelberg GTO, 2017. Images from: Ayvalik, Amsterdam, Florence, Instanbul, New York City, Rome, San Diego, and Venice, Italy. Paper Architecture was originally an arhitectural [sic] installation that included a large-scale book."</subfield>
    <subfield code="c">Back cover.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Contains photographs of buildings and architectural drawings.</subfield>
  </datafield>
